<%- include('partials/header', { lang: 'en', title: title, description: description, canonical: canonical, hreflang: hreflang, structuredData: structuredData }) %>

  <div class="container hero-section">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="text-gradient">URL to MP3</span> Converter</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Convert any video URL to a high-quality MP3 file online for free, directly in your browser.</p>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/converter', { lang: 'en', genericUrl: true }) %>
  </div>

  <section class="seo-section container">
    <div class="seo-card glass-panel">
      <h2>Free URL to MP3 converter online</h2>
      <p>ConveTube turns a video URL into an MP3 file in a few simple steps. Paste the link, let the converter prepare the audio, preview the result, and download it from your browser.</p>
      <p>There is no software to install and no account required. The URL to MP3 converter works on modern phones, tablets, laptops, and desktop computers.</p>
      <p class="link-paragraph">Looking for a Spanish tool? Try our <a href="/convertidor-de-youtube-a-mp3" class="inline-link">Spanish MP3 converter</a>. For uncompressed audio, use our <a href="/youtube-to-wav" class="inline-link">WAV converter</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="seo-grid">
      <div class="seo-card glass-panel">
        <h2>How to convert a URL to MP3</h2>
        <ol class="steps-list">
          <li><strong>Copy the URL:</strong> copy the link of the video you want to convert.</li>
          <li><strong>Paste the link:</strong> add the URL to the converter above and start the audio analysis.</li>
          <li><strong>Download MP3:</strong> preview the audio when it is ready, then save the MP3 file to your device.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="seo-card glass-panel flex-center">
        <img src="/images/conversion_steps.png" alt="Steps to convert a URL to MP3 with ConveTube" width="400" height="400" class="seo-img" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="seo-card glass-panel">
      <h2>Why use ConveTube?</h2>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-item"><span class="feature-icon">⚡</span><h3>Fast URL conversion</h3><p>Process a video link and prepare the MP3 without unnecessary steps or waiting rooms.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-item"><span class="feature-icon">🌐</span><h3>Works in your browser</h3><p>Use the converter on a phone, tablet, or computer without installing a desktop application.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-item"><span class="feature-icon">🎧</span><h3>Preview before download</h3><p>Check the audio result in the built-in player before saving the MP3 file.</p></div>
        <div class="feature-item"><span class="feature-icon">🔒</span><h3>Simple and private</h3><p>Convert a URL with a clean interface and no mandatory registration.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="seo-card glass-panel">
      <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>What is a URL to MP3 converter?</h3><p>A URL to MP3 converter turns a supported video URL into an MP3 audio file that you can save and play on your device.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>Can I convert any video URL to MP3?</h3><p>Yes. Paste a supported video URL, wait for the audio analysis, and download the MP3 when the result is ready.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>Is the URL to MP3 converter free?</h3><p>Yes. ConveTube provides the URL to MP3 conversion flow online for free, with no required account or subscription.</p></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><h3>Do I need to install software?</h3><p>No. The converter runs in a modern web browser, so you can convert a URL to MP3 without installing additional software.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<style>
  .hero-section { text-align: center; padding: 60px 0 20px; }
  .hero-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .hero-title { font-size: 3rem; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15; }
  .hero-subtitle { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .seo-section { margin-top: 60px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 30px; }
  .seo-card { padding: 36px; }
  .seo-card h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--color-text-primary); }
  .seo-card p { color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .seo-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .link-paragraph { border-top: 1px solid rgba(44, 40, 36, 0.08); padding-top: 16px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .inline-link { color: #C4593D; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  .inline-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .seo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr; gap: 30px; }
  .flex-center { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; padding: 20px; }
  .seo-img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 40, 36, 0.08); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .steps-list { margin-left: 20px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .steps-list li { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .steps-list strong { color: var(--color-text-primary); }
  .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  .feature-item { background: var(--bg-secondary); border: 1px solid rgba(44, 40, 36, 0.06); padding: 20px; border-radius: 14px; }
  .feature-icon { display: block; font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .feature-item h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--color-text-primary); }
  .feature-item p { margin: 0; }
  .faq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(44, 40, 36, 0.08); padding-bottom: 16px; }
  .faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .faq-item h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--color-text-primary); }
  .faq-item p { margin: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .seo-grid, .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .hero-title { font-size: 2.25rem; } .seo-card { padding: 26px; } }
</style>

